      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Right after leaving the white jade hall, Fang Yuan is vexed about subduing the Imperial Court land spirit. His plan, if he became owner, was to order the land spirit to stay inside the white jade hall while cooperating with Eighty-Eight True Yang Building’s operations.",
